      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are some behavioral indicators or \"red flags\" that may suggest someone is planning a crime or is about to become a threat in high-density urban environments:\n\n* Sudden or unusual changes in behavior, such as nervously fidgeting or avoiding eye contact.\n* Individuals carrying large amounts of cash or unusual items like scissors, knives, or SD cards.\n* People who appear out of place in an area, such as someone dressed in layers or carrying an excessive backpack.\n* Aggressive or overly aggressive behavior, such as staring, following, or obstructive blocking.\n* Suspicions about suspicious packages, loose packages, or people with bulky items like boxes or bags.\n* Unusual packaging, sealing, or stuffing of irregular shapes in trash or vehicles.",
